    "title": "Is Your Espresso Machine Trying to Tell You Something? 5 Failures Baristas Can Catch Early - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By baristamagazine ,\n2 days ago\nThe espresso machine failures that coffee repair shops see most often + small habits baristas can develop to keep them away. Most café machines that end up on our bench at SoCal Coffee Repair in Whittier, Calif., didn’t die all at once. They warned people for weeks first. A pump that sounded a little rougher than before. Shot times that kept creeping up. A small puddle under the drip tray that nobody had time to chase during the morning rush. When the machine finally quits, the repair is bigger and the downtime hits at the worst possible moment.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
